abel text next to the indicator. `orientation` also sets keyboard-navigation direction and ARIA."},"1018":{"id":"/docs/components/radio-37","page_id":"/docs/components/radio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/radio#data-attributes","content":"Components automatically add data attributes for styling different states:"},"1019":{"id":"/docs/components/radio-38","page_id":"/docs/components/radio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/radio#data-attributes","content":"**RadioGroup Container:** `data-invalid`, `data-disabled`, `data-required`, `data-readonly`, `data-orientation`"},"1020":{"id":"/docs/components/radio-39","page_id":"/docs/components/radio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/radio#data-attributes","content":"**Radio Button:** `data-selected`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focused`, `data-disabled`"},"1021":{"id":"/docs/components/radio-40","page_id":"/docs/components/radio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/radio#component-customization","content":"Pass `className` or `style` to customize a radio field container. Use descendant data-attribute selectors to style the interactive radio state:"},"1022":{"id":"/docs/components/radio-41","page_id":"/docs/components/radio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/radio#keyboard-navigation","content":"**Tab**: Moves focus to/from the radio group"},"1023":{"id":"/docs/components/radio-42","page_id":"/docs/components/radio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/radio#keyboard-navigation","content":"**Arrow Down/Right**: Move to next radio button"},"1024":{"id":"/docs/components/radio-43","page_id":"/docs/components/radio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/radio#keyboard-navigation","content":"**Arrow Up/Left**: Move to previous radio button"},"1025":{"id":"/docs/components/radio-44","page_id":"/docs/components/radio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/radio#keyboard-navigation","content":"**Space**: Select the focus